  "factorMethod.I_FEAS": "Формула: I_FEAS = 0.15 × N(politicalStability) + 0.12 × N(governmentEffectiveness) + 0.12 × N(regulatoryQuality) + 0.12 × N(ruleOfLaw) + 0.09 × N(controlCorruption) + 0.14 × N(logisticsPerformanceIndex) + 0.11 × N(internetUsersPct) + 0.08 × N(urbanPopulationPct) + 0.07 × N(partnerUniversitiesMgimoCount).",
